    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### qTox Version\n\n1.18.3\n\n### Commit Hash\n\ne15c9a54f8e2c1d59a4b144813bf06b6f0d7a022\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Qt Version\n\n6.10.2\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Go to the qtox-toktok github page, find a link to AUR package for Arch (https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/qtox-toktok)\n2. Have an up-to-date installation of Arch\n3. Try to build said package (doesn't matter, manually via makepkg -si or via paru or other helper)\n4. Build will succeed, one test will fail, packaging will fail due to that\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\nTest \"test_bsu\" always fails.\n\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nTests should pass properly.\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nAlways\n\n### Operating System\n\nLinux\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nArch rolling, fully up-to-date (22 feb '26)\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n7/24 Testing: test_bsu\n7/24 Test: test_bsu\nCommand: \"/home/username/.cache/paru/clone/qtox-toktok/src/qTox/_build/test_bsu\"\nDirectory: /home/username/.cache/paru/clone/qtox-toktok/src/qTox/_build\n\"test_bsu\" start time: Feb 22 14:19 MSK\nOutput:\n----------------------------------------------------------\n********* Start testing of TestBootstrapNodesUpdater *********\nConfig: Using QtTest library 6.10.2, Qt 6.10.2 (x86_64-little_endian-lp64 shared (dynamic) release build; by GCC 15.2.1 20260103), arch unknown\nPASS   : TestBootstrapNodesUpdater::initTestCase()\nQDEBUG : TestBootstrapNodesUpdater::testOnline() Forcing non-portable\nFAIL!  : TestBootstrapNodesUpdater::testOnline() Compared values are not the same\n   Actual   (spy.count()): 0\n   Expected (1)          : 1\n   Loc: [/usr/src/debug/qtox-toktok/qTox/test/net/bsu_test.cpp(48)]\nPASS   : TestBootstrapNodesUpdater::testLocal()\nPASS   : TestBootstrapNodesUpdater::cleanupTestCase()\nTotals: 3 passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped, 0 blacklisted, 10036ms\n********* Finished testing of TestBootstrapNodesUpdater *********\n<end of output>\nTest time =  10.06 sec\n----------------------------------------------------------\nTest Failed.\n\"test_bsu\" end time: Feb 22 14:19 MSK\n\"test_bsu\" time elapsed: 00:00:10\n```",
